---
/* 04 · Japan — the round of 16 as a horizontal track, in the same language as the group stage:
   half-time in Rostov · 0–2 in four minutes · the double change · level with sixteen minutes to play.
   Pieces arrive as their panel crosses the screen (data-at is the panel's own progress). */
import PlayerSticker from '../../ui/PlayerSticker.astro';
import Photo from '../../ui/Photo.astro';
import Ticket from '../../ui/Ticket.astro';
import Sticker from '../../ui/Sticker.astro';
import Doodle from '../../ui/Doodle.astro';
import Marks from '../../ui/Marks.astro';
---
<!-- ═══════════ 04 — THE MOMENT — JAPAN ═══════════ -->
<section class="scene s-jpn bg-w paper" data-scene data-track data-chapter="04|The Moment — Japan" data-poster="1" style="--len:4.8;--opp:var(--jpn);--opp2:var(--w)">
  <div class="pin">
    <div class="track">

      <!-- half-time -->
      <div class="panel jn0 bg-w paper">
        <Marks kind="shards" seed={6} n={13} class="o" data-in style="left:34vw;top:-6vh;--mz:min(62vw,104vh)" />
        <Doodle name="ball" data-in style="left:72vw;top:57.5vh;--dz:8vw;--rot:-14deg;--d:.6s" />
        <p class="mono lab jn-lab">04 — The Moment<br>Round of 16 · Rostov Arena · 2 July 2018</p>
        <i class="jn-sun fx-drop" data-in aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h2 class="jn-h" aria-label="Japan."><span class="d mega sp" data-split data-in>Japan</span></h2>
        <span class="scrawl jn-scr fx-scrawl" data-in style="--d:.6s" aria-hidden="true">round of sixteen</span>
        <div class="sc d jn-sc0" role="img" aria-label="Half-time: Belgium 0, Japan 0">
          <span class="cutn c-bel fx-stamp" data-in style="--h:21;--rot:-4deg;--d:.5s"><i>0</i></span>
          <span class="cutn c-opp fx-stamp" data-in style="--h:21;--rot:5deg;--d:.62s"><i>0</i></span>
        </div>
        <Ticket match={54} class="jn-tk fx-slide" data-in style="--rot:-7deg;--fx:-60vw;--d:.3s" />
        <Sticker type="jersey" a="10" data-in style="left:39vw;top:63vh;--iz:8vw;--rot:-8deg;--d:.8s" /><Sticker type="pill" a="JAPAN" b="ROUND OF 16" class="jn-pill" data-in style="--rot:7deg;--c1:var(--jpn);--d:1s" />
        <div class="slip jn-slip jn-s0 fx-paste" data-torn="tb" data-in style="--rot:1.4deg;--d:.7s"><b class="d">Half-time.</b><p>Nothing in it. A quiet evening by the Don. Scroll slowly; it is the last calm minute of the night.</p></div>
        <span class="hand c-r jn-h0" data-in style="--d:1.1s">att. 41,466</span>
      </div>

      <!-- 0–2 -->
      <div class="panel jn1 bg-r" data-torn="l" data-torn-d="12">
        <p class="mono m-meta">Second half<br>48′ · 52′</p>
        <div class="sc d jn-sc1" role="img" aria-label="Belgium 0, Japan 2">
          <span class="cutn c-bel inv fx-stamp" data-at=".14" style="--h:56;--rot:-4deg"><i>0</i></span>
          <span class="cutn c-opp pale fx-stamp" data-at=".2" style="--h:56;--rot:5deg"><i><span data-count="2" data-count-at=".22">2</span></i></span>
        </div>
        <Sticker type="hex" a="0—2" b="52′" class="k jn-hex fx-stamp" data-at=".3" style="--rot:9deg" />
        <div class="slip jn-slip jn-s1 fx-slide" data-torn="tb" data-at=".24" style="--rot:-1.6deg;--fx:50vw"><b class="d">48′ Haraguchi.</b><p>Shibasaki slides a pass through the left side of the Belgian defence. Haraguchi runs on and shoots across Courtois.</p></div>
        <span class="hand c-y jn-four" data-at=".32">four minutes.</span>
        <div class="slip jn-slip jn-s2 fx-paste" data-torn="tb" data-at=".34" style="--rot:1.8deg"><b class="d">52′ Inui.</b><p>Twenty-five yards out. A yard of space. Bottom corner.</p></div>
        <Doodle name="bolt" class="w" data-at=".3" style="left:90vw;top:60vh;--dz:8vw;--rot:12deg" /><Marks kind="speed" seed={6} data-at=".34" style="left:30vw;top:8vh;--mz:16vw;z-index:4" /><p class="m-cut jn-fact fx-unroll" data-at=".4"><span>No team had come back from two goals down to win a World Cup knockout match inside ninety minutes <em>since 1966.</em></span></p>
      </div>

      <!-- the double change -->
      <div class="panel jn2 bg-y paper" data-torn="l" data-torn-d="12">
        <Marks kind="brush" seed={12} n={12} data-at=".16" style="left:42vw;top:-4vh;--mz:min(58vw,100vh)" />
        <Doodle name="bolt" class="r" data-at=".3" style="left:40vw;top:58vh;--dz:9vw;--rot:-10deg" />
        <p class="mono m-meta">65′<br>A double change</p>
        <h3 class="d jn-sub" data-at=".14"><s>Mertens</s> Fellaini.<br><s>Carrasco</s> Chadli.</h3>
        <span class="scrawl jn-plan fx-scrawl" data-at=".26" aria-hidden="true">plan B</span>
        <!-- the two stickers the album was missing -->
        <PlayerSticker photo="fellaini" number="8" name="Fellaini" class="jn-st1" data-at=".22" style="--rot:-7deg" />
        <PlayerSticker photo="chadli" number="22" name="Chadli" class="jn-st2" data-at=".28" style="--rot:6deg" />
        <span class="pencil jn-got" data-at=".36">got them. 65′</span>
        <Sticker type="rnd" a="65′" b="2 CHANGES" class="k jn-65 fx-stamp" data-at=".2" style="--rot:-9deg" />
        <div class="slip jn-slip jn-s5 fx-paste" data-torn="tb" data-at=".34" style="--rot:-1.2deg"><p>A double change. It looks like a gamble. It is the whole story.</p></div>
      </div>

      <!-- level -->
      <div class="panel jn3 bg-w paper" data-torn="l" data-torn-d="12">
        <Marks kind="rays" seed={7} n={22} data-at=".3" style="left:22vw;top:38vh;--mz:30vw;z-index:4" />
        <Doodle name="flame" data-at=".4" style="left:56vw;top:60vh;--dz:8vw;--rot:8deg" />
        <Marks kind="crosses" seed={5} data-at=".36" style="left:40vw;top:10vh;--mz:20vw" />
        <p class="mono m-meta">69′ · 74′<br>Sixteen minutes to play</p>
        <div class="sc d jn-sc3" role="img" aria-label="Belgium 2, Japan 2">
          <span class="cutn c-bel fx-stamp" data-at=".14" style="--h:56;--rot:-4deg"><i><span data-count="2" data-count-at=".16">2</span></i></span>
          <span class="cutn c-opp fx-stamp" data-at=".2" style="--h:56;--rot:5deg"><i>2</i></span>
        </div>
        <Photo name="vertonghen" print class="jn-p1 fx-slap" caption="Vertonghen, Rostov" tape="t" data-at=".24" style="--rot:4deg;--ar:4/3" />
        <Photo name="kdbJapan" print class="jn-p2 fx-drop" caption="watch De Bruyne" pin data-at=".36" style="--rot:-5deg;--ar:3/4" />
        <Sticker type="rnd" a="69′" b="1—2" class="y jn-69 fx-stamp" data-at=".28" style="--rot:-10deg" /><Sticker type="hex" a="LEVEL" b="74′" class="jn-74 fx-stamp" data-at=".4" style="--rot:8deg" />
        <div class="slip jn-slip jn-s3 fx-slide" data-torn="tb" data-at=".3" style="--rot:-1.5deg;--fx:-50vw"><b class="d">69′ Vertonghen.</b><p>A half-cleared corner. A header looped from the left of the box, over Kawashima, into the far corner. Nobody is quite sure he meant it.</p></div>
        <div class="slip jn-slip jn-s4 fx-paste" data-torn="tb" data-at=".38" style="--rot:1.6deg"><b class="d">74′ Fellaini.</b><p>Hazard twists on the left and crosses. Fellaini climbs above his marker. Level. Sixteen minutes to play.</p></div>
        <span class="hand c-r jn-on" data-at=".44">game on</span>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
